    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800080/extras/d6f7a8f07425ffd38dca0c89e1c98c04.avif?t=1745811536\" /></div><br>After the Second World War, a large amount of<br>ex-combatants without a place to return were recruited by<br>a mercenary army under the command of former General Albert Hessler,<br>a man without a nation and with only one objective \u2026 war.<br><br>In response to this, the United Nations through the SDU(Special Defense<br>Unit), creates a group under the name of VALKYRIAS.<br>This squad, made up of elite pilots, will have the<br>responsibility to stop Hessler\u2019s ambitions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><strong>Story mode</strong><br> \u2022 Fight through 12 stages.<br> \u2022 Play Cooperative or Solo.<br> \u2022 3 difficulty levels.<br> \u2022 Select between four (4) different pilots, each pilot have an unique introductory level.<br> \u2022 9 aircrafts to Unlock and upgrade.<br><br><strong>Game Mechanics</strong><br>Rising Sun have four different type of game mechanics.<br><br><i>Normal Mode</i><br>Traditional Shoot 'em up mechanics.<br><i>Boss Mode</i><br>Battle against heavy armoured enemies.<br><i>Dogfight Mode</i><br>Shooter on rails mechanics.<br><i>Attack Mode</i><br>Flight to your objective evading enemy attacks.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800080/extras/9b6e3c74e908f909c8fef198efeb50b0.avif?t=1745811536\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800080/extras/d6f7a8f07425ffd38dca0c89e1c98c04.avif?t=1745811536\" /></div><br>After the Second World War, a large amount of<br>ex-combatants without a place to return were recruited by<br>a mercenary army under the command of former General Albert Hessler,<br>a man without a nation and with only one objective \u2026 war.<br><br>In response to this, the United Nations through the SDU(Special Defense<br>Unit), creates a group under the name of VALKYRIAS.<br>This squad, made up of elite pilots, will have the<br>responsibility to stop Hessler\u2019s ambitions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><strong>Story mode</strong><br> \u2022 Fight through 12 stages.<br> \u2022 Play Cooperative or Solo.<br> \u2022 3 difficulty levels.<br> \u2022 Select between four (4) different pilots, each pilot have an unique introductory level.<br> \u2022 9 aircrafts to Unlock and upgrade.<br><br><strong>Game Mechanics</strong><br>Rising Sun have four different type of game mechanics.<br><br><i>Normal Mode</i><br>Traditional Shoot 'em up mechanics.<br><i>Boss Mode</i><br>Battle against heavy armoured enemies.<br><i>Dogfight Mode</i><br>Shooter on rails mechanics.<br><i>Attack Mode</i><br>Flight to your objective evading enemy attacks.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800080/extras/9b6e3c74e908f909c8fef198efeb50b0.avif?t=1745811536\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "The Valkirias are here. Fast paced action Shoot 'em up with beautifully rendered 3D graphics. Select between four characters with different abilities and follow their story. Upgrade and unlock fighters, battle bosses and play amazing special stages, solo or with a friend.",
